OL,3,GNEWSAHepworth piece could fetch up to
OL,4,A#8m at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "pivotal masterwork" by Dame Barbara
OL,7,FHepworth inspired by the Cornish
OL,8,Flandscape is expected to sell for up to
OL,9,F#8m at auction.
OL,11,FHepworth carved Sculpture with Colour
OL,12,F(Eos) in 1946 and named it after the
OL,13,FGreek goddess of dawn.
OL,15,FAuction house Christie said it would be
OL,16,Fthe highlight of a modern British and
OL,17,FIrish art sale on 21 October and was
OL,18,Festimated to sell between #5m and #8m.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
